window.products.push({"id":1017222,"name":"Erigeron Non-Slip Bath Mats and Indoor Outdoor Doormats 2-Piece Set Chenille Shaggy Rugs,Ultra Soft Absorbent Mats for Bathroom, Tub and Shower (Red,1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tuZ-dIpbS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ultra Absorbent and Super Soft: Erigeron bath mats and doormats are made of thousands of individual microfiber high-pile, thick Chenille fabric helps save your floors from dripping water while you step out of the Tub, Shower or getting ready by the Sink. Thick fabric and high-pile helps the mats dry quickly and cleanly leaving fresh mats, free of mold or mildew. Pamper your feet! Our bath mat features a luxurious, soft pile that soothes tired feet and shields toes from the cold floor. Non-skid: Non slip bottom features high quality mesh PVC material to prevent the mat from shifting and skidding, protecting you and family from any slip in the bathroom. Care tips: Bathroom rugs are easy to clean, and they can conveniently be thrown in any washing machine and gently tumble dry on low heat. Super soft microfiber material will not shrink or turn rough even after the wash, which will keep your rug same for a very long time. !!!Cuaution: Place Mats on Clean Dry Floor Only, water or other fluids under mats maybe slippery and make you fall down, therefore, do keep the bottom dry before use, and test with foot to ensure it doesn't move for safety sake. Customer Service: We offer 10-Year promising warranty, feel free to contact us for any product issues, Erigeron Bedding will be always at your service if you are not 100% satisfied with our products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tuZ-dIpbS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Erigeron","source_asin":"B08M16PLYT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1017222","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M16PLYT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M16PLYT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1017223,"name":"Seiko Bedside Alarm Clock Silver-Tone Metallic Case","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pcjxAKATL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Seiko Story From Humble beginnings, Kintaro Hattoris Vision for Seiko has become reality. A consuming passion for excellence - imprinted in our Corporate DNA passed from generation to generation. Seiko, for 125 years committed to the art and science of time. A culture of innovation connects a 19th century Tokyo clock shop with 20th century advances in timekeeping to an extraordinary 21st century \"quiet revolution.\" Continually driven by dedication and passion, established a multitude of worlds first technologies transforming the principles of timekeeping. The first quartz wristwatch  changed the history of time. The first Kinetic  marked a new era in quartz watch technology. In 1969, Seiko Astron, the first quartz wristwatch - was introduced. In an instant, Seiko exponentially improved the accuracy of wristwatches And Seiko technology firmly established todays standard in Olympic and sports timing. 1984, another celebrated first  Kinetic Technology  powered by body movement. Kinetic  a quartz mechanism with unparalleled accuracy the driving force behind more worlds firsts. Kinetic Chronograph  the next generation of high performance timekeeping. Kinetic Auto Relay  automatically resets to the correct time. Kinetic Perpetual - combining the date perfect technology of perpetual calendar with the genius of Kinetic Auto Relay. And now Kinetic Direct Drive  move, and the watch is powered automatically. Or hand wind it and see the power you are generating in real time. In the realm of fine watches, time is measured by Seiko innovation  A heritage of dedication to the art and science of time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pcjxAKATL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEIKO","source_asin":"B000AL0NUQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1017223","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000AL0NUQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000AL0NUQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
