window.products.push({"id":1017291,"name":"Air Fryer, 4.8QT Airfryers 1400W 7-in-1 Hot Oven Oilless, Digital Touchscreen Air Frier Cookers with Nonstick Basket & Recipe Book","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514M9ots9zL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Less Fat & Less Time - Mimic the results of deep-frying, this air fryer will promise you the same delicious taste of fried foods with little or no oil, giving you a healthier lifestyle. With 360° rapid hot air circulation technology and 1400W power, this air fryer cooks faster than a conventional oven and makes the food crispier outside and tender inside. Family-Sized Capacity - This airfryer has a capacity of 4.8QT which is suitable for families of 3-5 people or singles and require less counter space. It can hold 2lb. French fries, 20 chicken wings, a 2.5lb chicken, or a 5” pizza. All-in-1 Machine - Air fry, bake, grill, roast, and toast, this handy gadget can make pretty much everything, from appetizers to main dishes, and even desserts! Built-in 7 presets for popular foods—French Fries, Pizza, Shrimp, Desserts, Chicken, Fish, and Steak— to make the cooking process easier. Also comes with a recipe book to give you some inspiration for your meal. Easy to Use & Clean - Featured with digital touchscreen and simple icons, easy to operate the air frier cooker with one tap. Perfect for beginner. Cooking is free from splattering oil vapor all over your kitchen countertop and won’t heat up your kitchen. You can cook with no hassle and no mess. The nonstick surface of the basket results in less food residue being left behind. Additionally, nonstick basket and tray are dishwasher safe. Makes the cleanup a breeze! Safely Use & Enjoy Our Warranty - Anti-scalding handle with high-quality materials is ergonomic. You can push and pull freely without the risk of scald injury. PFOA-free & BPA-free, UL approved. [Sincere Service] - We provide sincere After-sale Customer Service and you will get our promise of a 24-month guarantee for this air fryer. If you have any problems with this air fryer, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514M9ots9zL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vvwgkpk","source_asin":"B09S31763X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1017291","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S31763X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S31763X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
