window.products.push({"id":1017339,"name":"Chefman RJ15-5-P Programmable Slow Cooker, 5 quart, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41tGHnOnbWL._AC_.jpg","description":"There is no easier way to prepare hot, delicious meals than with the Chefman 5QT Programmable Slow Cooker. It can be set from 30 minutes to 12 hours in advance, which means it can be set in the morning to cook to completion and then automatically switch to the warm setting, keeping food heated until you're ready to serve. Its non-skid feet keep the slow cooker in place, and dishwasher-safe parts simplify clean up, making this Slow Cooker a must have for all homes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41tGHnOnbWL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chefman","source_asin":"B016ZJQPLW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1017339","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016ZJQPLW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016ZJQPLW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1017340,"name":"Alliebe 50 Pack 32 oz Meal Prep Container,Lunch Bento Fruit Box with Lids,Portable Lunch Food Storage Containers Kitchen Food Take-Out Camping Picnic ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mhmY4voHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Prepare and package up your meals ahead of time. These food containers with lids will prevent freezer burn and any absorbing of other odors from the freezer. NOTE: When freezing, do not try to squeeze it into a narrow space, otherwise they will break. Before removing the cover, make sure that it has been thawed, although a small amount of warm water will balance the air pressure, so you can remove the cover. The hard-plastic construction will ensure no cracks or breaking along the way. The leak proof lids will tightly seal the food containers for meal prepping, preventing any annoying leaks or spills in your bag or freezer. To ensures this container set meets all your needs. Perfect for: packed lunches, takeout and delivery. Prep hot or cold meals: salad, sandwich, snack, fresh fruit, dip, breakfast, lunch, dinner, leftovers, and kids meals. Prep meals worry free, our food prep containers durable design has a high tolerance for bending, twisting and temperature, plus our airtight, leak-proof lids seal tight, keeping your food safe and secure. You can reuse these durable containers as many times as you like. Clean these portion control boxes easily by placing on the top rack of the dishwasher. If you don’t want to reuse them you can simply throw these containers into a recycling bin or trash. Stackable and lightweight design allows for easy storage. Washable, reusable, and microwave safe. Containers can be reheated or frozen and withstand temperatures in the range of (-40°F to 270°F) or ( -40°C to 132°C). Strong crack resistant material is dishwasher safe and can be washed in the top rack of the dishwasher repeatedly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mhmY4voHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alliebe","source_asin":"B0BQJSDM8W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1017340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQJSDM8W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQJSDM8W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1017341,"name":"Six Grey Collapsible Storage Containers With Reinforced Bottom: Storage Bins That Slide Together for a Durable, Stylish Storage Cabinet - Drawer Organ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61g0QJlX9JL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Store and Score Are you sick of huge storage bins that take up too much room? Or small cubes that simply can’t hold enough of your gear? Or ungainly drawers that don’t slide in and out like they should? Then you’ll want to try out the HomeFresco Foldable Storage System. It’s small enough to be portable but large enough to hold a significant amount; it’s durable enough to withstand the test of time in a garage, basement, closet or kitchen; and it’s seamless enough that each drawer slides easily into place. It’s the storage solution you always thought was a no-brainer, now finally available to adapt to your storage needs. Neat and Tidy : If your storage solution doesn’t fit well together, it’s nothing more than a bunch of bins taking up space. Our space-saving six-drawer system goes together like clockwork, enabling you to store as much or as little as you need and collapse the rest. Endless Possibilities : There are so many ways to use your storage bins, you may find you want more than just a six-pack. Tools in the garage? Arts and crafts in the closet? Your best dinnerware? Party supplies that don’t come out too often? You name it; you can store it. The Two-Year Difference : You won’t find this with the competition. We’re so confident in the quality of our drawers that we provide a two-year warranty. If anything adverse happens to your storage system within two years, just let us know and your replacement will be on the way. Give The Gift Of Storage : Boring? Maybe. But boy is it useful. You’ll be amazed at how your friends or family will thank you when you give them the means to organize their lives in style. Sure, you may have to give them a few pointers, but it’ll be worth it. So whether you need six drawers or 24, add HomeFresco To Your Cart Now","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61g0QJlX9JL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"homefresco","source_asin":"B01B9PYNIO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1017341","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01B9PYNIO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01B9PYNIO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
