window.products.push({"id":1017371,"name":"Esright Power Lift Recliner Chair for Elderly, Faux Leather with Rivet Design Electric Recliner Chair with Heated Vibration Massage, Side Pockets & US","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":379.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Lry5XqX4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【ABOUT Esright】 - Esright always attach importance to our principles of bringing quality and comfort to people around the world. We insist on choosing environmentally friendly timber with higher production costs. All wood boards are formaldehyde-free, conform to the P2 Requirement of California Air Resources Board (CARB). Durable steel construction ensures long time use. We are committed to protect the health of the elderly who choose our electric lift chair. 【UL Approved Silent Lift Motor】 - Designed with right side control panel, our lift recliner chair reclines up to 150 degrees. Footrest and backrest are extended or retracted simultaneously. With our powerful silent lift motor, our lift chair can push the entire chair up to help the senior stand up easily without adding stress to back or knees. You can smoothly adjust to customized position and stop lifting or reclining at any position you need. 【USB Port & Lift Control Panel & Heated Vibration Massage】 - Lift & Recline control panel is designed on the right side and integrated with USB charging function, easy to operate. (Note:The USB port is ONLY for Low-Power devices, such as Phone, iPad or Headset). This lift chair also has heated vibration massage function. There are 4 areas of massage (neck, lumbar, thigh and leg) and 5 modes (pulse, press, wave, auto, normal). 【Artificial Leather and Overstuffed Padding】: Lining Springs with Overstuffed backrest and padding cushion will bring you more comfort, just like your whole body is wrapped up in chair. The recliner covered by high-quality artificial leather, brings more luxury than leather. What's more, leather surface makes the chair dirty resistant and very easy to clean. Our chair can recline up to 150 degrees, which will be a good angle to take a rest or watch TV. 【Long Time Professional Service】: Come in 2 boxes and includes assemble & use instructions. Super easy assemble and usually only need 10-15mins to finish the installation, no tools required. If any shipping damage occurs when it arrives or defective during usage, please feel free to contact us. We will provide best solution in 24 hours. We also provide 1 year technical support for the lift motor and steel frame. Please start to assemble the chair when you have 2 boxes received.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Lry5XqX4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Esright","source_asin":"B08DJ2GLLL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1017371","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DJ2GLLL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DJ2GLLL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
