window.products.push({"id":1017392,"name":"Magic Bartender Kit, 13 Piece Boston Cocktail Shaker Bar Tool Set with Stand : 1&2 oz Jigger, Weighted Boston Shaker, Professional Strainer Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713H-ZXYogL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Everything You Need】: Different from the jigger that can only measure 1/2 oz and 1 oz in other bartender kits, our jigger has 1/2, 3/4, 1, 11/2, and 2 oz measurement lines, which will help you accurately measure the amount of ingredients needed to make a standard flavored cocktail. The colorful cocktail recipe cards list 16 common cocktail recipes, allowing you to make cocktails like a professional bartender. All tools are made of 304 stainless steel and can be cleaned safely in the dishwasher. 【Double Bottom Design Of Shaker】: When shaking the ice wine mixture, our 0.8 mm thicker double bottom bartender grade shakers will leave the chill of the ice on the first bottom surface, and the hands in contact with the second bottom surface will not be affected, so your hands won't get frostbite. Whether you are a man or a woman, your hands will be cared for. Sure, the perfect combination of 18 oz and 28 oz shakers is enough to make 2-3 cocktails at once. 【Professional Strainer Set】: The ergonomic shape of the Hawthorne Strainer can provide the best finger grip, which can help you to reduce hand pressure. The high-quality tightly wound springs can achieve a good filtering effect. The Fine Mesh Strainer can filter the minimum amount of crushed ice and a small amount of lime or mint. So this strainer set can meet the needs of all bars/home bars for perfect dual-filtered beverages. 【Fashionable Stand For Storage And Display】: With this Bamboo Stand, your kitchen drawers are no longer messy. Not only that, the lower groove design of the bamboo stand can firmly fix the tools above, even if the bamboo stand is moved, the Bar Spoon and Muddler will not fall.->Attracting the attention of guests is as simple as that and this stylish bamboo stand will upgrade your home decoration. 【The Best Gift】: First-class Bartender tools + stylish bamboo display stand + exquisite cocktail recipe card, this perfect product is packaged in a beautiful and sturdy colorful gift box. Your recipient will be as excited as a sugar shop kid! Whether it is a birthday, an anniversary, a wedding, Father's day or Christmas, it will be a surprise gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713H-ZXYogL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magic barware","source_asin":"B08YR2M281","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1017392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YR2M281","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YR2M281","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
