window.products.push({"id":1017444,"name":"Lemfema Heat Powered Stove Fan, 4 Blades Fireplace Fan with Magnetic Thermometer for Wood/Log Burner/Gas/Pellet/Fireplace","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kieO-vHyS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"▶【ENERGY EFFICIENT AND ECO-FRIENDLY】: No battery or power Required - The use of thermal power generation fan, used to cycle the hot air produced by wood burning fireplace. There is a thermoelectric module on the fan, which acts as a generator to drive the motor of the fan. When the generator experiences the heat difference between the top and bottom surfaces, it generates current. ▶【FEATURE AND WARNING】: Working temperature 60-350°c. Optimum operating temp 80-250°c (176-482°F). Noise≦35Db, quiet operation. Do not over 350°c (662°F). Temperatures above this range may damage the fan and generator set. Place the fan on the smooth flat surface of the top, near the side or back of the chimney. ▶【SIMPLE OPERATE】: Putting the fan on the furnace will absorb heat energy to drive the fan to rotate, blow the hot air above the fireplace to the living area, increase the air circulation in the room and improve the heating efficiency of the furnace. The rotation speed of the fan depends on the temperature of the furnace. When the temperature of the furnace is high, the rotation speed is fast. When the temperature of the furnace is low enough go out, the rotation speed will slow down to stop. ▶【SILENT OPERATION】:The fan works under 35db, it runs very quietly, there is no noise, you can hardly hear any sound, you don't even know where the fan is, but you will still feel warm, it improves the circulation of indoor hot air, you Will enjoy the warm air in a quiet and comfortable environment. ▶【GUARANTEE AND SERVICE】: The fireplace fan complete with one-year warranty. If the fan ever failure, simply contact us for a replacement or refund, our customer service will reply you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kieO-vHyS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lemfema","source_asin":"B0BRXD75G6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1017444","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRXD75G6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRXD75G6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
