window.products.push({"id":1017631,"name":"SANNO Large Freezer Baskets Metal Storage Organizer Bin Basket Wire Storage Basket for Kitchen Pantry Bathroom Set of 3 Large Metal Farmhouse Food Fru","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613+kc0FwbL._AC_SL1120_.jpg","description":"SIMPLE CARE:Product size is 14\"L x 11\" W x 6\"H Made of durable and sturdy materials, food safe, easy to care-clean with mild soap and water, Do not wash in the washing machine and dishwasher, the wire basket set lining is waterproof-any type of liquid spill can be easily wiped and clean. We just want to create a tidy home environment for you. SAVE SPACE:The farmhouse wire mesh basket keeps your food storage racks and kitchen counters organized and no longer messy. It can save you a lot of space and store it in the refrigerator, freezer, cabinet, cupboard, pantry or drawer space to the greatest extent. It is very suitable for storing dry goods in the food storage room; use side by side or stack to store vertically. HOLLOW-CARVED DESIGN:The simple shape of the wrought iron line is elegant and unassuming, and the simple hollow design of the storage basket allows you to quickly find the items you want and store them in an orderly manner. The storage boxes placed in the kitchen and storage room ensure the surrounding air to circulate, so that your fruits and vegetables are freshly visible. METAL IRON MATERIAL:The interior is made of carbon steel, and the surface is rustproof coated, which is beautiful and practical.Organize all your daily necessities and create a convenient carrying basket to make organizing and daily life easier. The metal storage box has an easy-to-carry design, which can easily transport food from the pantry to the shelf and then to the dining table. WIDE RANGE OF USE: It is suitable for a variety of scenarios, making your home life full of fun. Put it in the closet, store clothes, pants, underwear, towels. Put it in the kitchen, store rice, oil, salt, sauce, vinegar and tea. Put it in the bathroom, store shampoo, shower gel. Put it in the living room, store fruits, snacks and household sundries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613+kc0FwbL._AC_SL1120_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SANNO","source_asin":"B08R3Q72C1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1017631","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R3Q72C1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R3Q72C1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
