window.products.push({"id":1017633,"name":"Hamilton Beach Aramco Skillet Frying Pan,12-Inch, Nonstick PFOA-Free Coating, High Performance Forged Aluminum, Induction Compatible, Stay-Cool Bakeli","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f7b2HaPeS._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"Sear, Brown, Fry, Poach & Sauté Like a Gourmet Chef! The Hamilton Beach 12-Inch Forged Aluminum Nonstick Skillet Frying Pan is a must-have cookware staple for every kitchen. Hamilton Beach meticulously designs cookware to feel right in their consumers’ hands establishing confidence for the finest cooking experience. This skillet is perfect for frying eggs and omelets, flipping pancakes or crepes, cooking chicken breast, searing meat, frying fish, reducing sauces, sautéing vegetables, stir frying, toasting nuts, cooking melting grilled cheese sandwiches, poaching your favorite foods, and reheating tasty leftovers. High-Performance Forged Aluminum Craftsmanship Robust, heavy-duty construction with forged aluminum is durable for years of enjoyment. Crafted with superior 4.5mm thick aluminum, the skillet is far stronger and sturdier than other skillets on the market that have a minimal, subpar thickness resulting in poor heat retention. Forged aluminum undergoes a specialized manufacturing process creating a high-performance material while maintaining the perfect weight to balance ratio. Aluminum offers excellent heat distribution while the thick bottom and walls provide superb heat retention for the best quality cook. This versatile skillet is compatible with most stovetops including gas, induction, electric, glass ceramic, and halogen. PFOA-Free Nonstick Surface Cookware with nonstick coating is an absolute joy to cook with and use. Never struggle with stuck-on food or worry about ruining delicate recipes again. XYLAN Plus PFOA-Free nonstick interior releases food effortlessly from the pan for the most rewarding cooking adventure and makes cleanup a breeze. The premium nonstick coating lasts much longer than other less durable nonstick coatings. Tricky and fragile food like eggs and fish slide off with ease for picture-perfect results. Bold, Modern Design with Soft Touch, Stay-Cool Bakelite Handle Sleek matte black with scarlet red handles makes a statement with a bold, modern design. The beautiful and striking color scheme is unique and not found in other cookware. An expertly designed handle comes equipped with Soft Touch, Stay-Cool Bakelite for the most comfortable, ergonomic grip that is heat resistant for your safety. For those who love to hang your cookware, the handles come ready to hang with easy-hanging holes. Unique Handle Shape for the Best Grip Unlike traditional rounded handles that can cause hands to cramp, the handle features a rectangular shape with a gradual taper. The handle is wide at the base to securely attach to the skillet and gradually narrows fitting perfectly into the palm of your hand. With this robust handle, inspire confidence every time you maneuver the skillet. A flat surface along the top of the handle provides an ergonomic thumb rest as you grip the handle – the unique handle shape is inviting and a delight to hold. Cleaning & Care The nonstick coating makes cleanup a breeze. To keep your skillet in peak condition, handwashing is recommended with drying immediately afterwards. As with all nonstick cookware, handwashing preserves the nonstick coating for the longest amount of time. For optimal performance, do not allow the skillet to sit submerged in water for extended periods of time. This skillet is designed exclusively for the stovetop and is not oven safe. Hamilton Beach The Hamilton Beach brand is one of the most universally recognized names in the kitchen and beyond for its quality household electrics. Now it’s time to experience the new Hamilton Beach cookware, cutlery, and kitchen gadgets lines, incorporating innovation, style, and product excellence consumers have come to expect with the Hamilton Beach name. This 12-Inch Forged Aluminum Nonstick Skillet Frying Pan is backed by a Manufacturer’s 1-Year Limited Warranty so you can buy with confidence knowing you will receive a high-quality product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f7b2HaPeS._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hamilton Beach","source_asin":"B095XKR93S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1017633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095XKR93S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095XKR93S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
