window.products.push({"id":1017769,"name":"CONBOLA Portable Camping Fan for Tents,10400mAh Battery Operated Fan,36 Hours Work Time, 9-Inch Outdoor Rechargeable Fan with LED Lantern,Hanging Hook","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i32sPmGyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Quiet Cooling】 - Do you want to cool down without the pesky background noise in the hot summer? The CONBOLA desk fan adopts lastest brushless motor and ultra-thin blades, the noise is less than 30db, ideal choice for noise-sensitive people. Whether you're studying, working or sleeping, it can provide the lasting coolness without sound disrupting. Enjoy all-day serenity and comfort! 【Battery Powered & Rechargeable】- Different from other products, the personal fan is build-in 10400 mAh battery, it can work continuously for 8-36 hours, and it support the cordless fan work on extremely hotwith no AC. Package include Type-C fast charging cable, and configured with 4 indicator light for reminding you to charge in time, bringing you more lasting coolness. No more worry about unusable when power outages or outdoor ! 【Powerful Wind & Air Circulation】: CONBOLA desk fan is designed with control knob to regulate powerful wind, it provided great cool air flow to circulate air throughout your whole room. Pair it with your air conditioners or humidifiers, that can speed up the effect of cooling or humidification and help you save energy and reduce energy bills. Suitable for office, home, bedroom or studio. 【Lightweight & Durable】 - Blade length: 2.5inch. Compact size will not take up much space, easily put into a backpack, made of premium ABS + PC material, wide sturdy base to prevent tipping over. No matter where you are, it can meet your needs at any time. Perfect companion for fishing, camping, trip, beach, hot sporting events and hiking! Summer coming up, so it will be put in good use! 【Bright LED Light】 - The fan designed with 3 brightness settings LED lantern, intended for satisfying your lighting requirement. Provided a soft and non-glaring light, protect your eyesight, enhance your nighttime use. Even if the power goes out suddenly, it has the most basic lighting function, and ideal for reading or studying at night. 【Adjustable Angle & Hanging Hook Design】 - The table fan has 270 °rotation adjustment, provides a cool breeze in desired direction. Equipped with hooks in the bottom, since you can articulate the fan and position it in anywhere, such as top of your tent, umbrella, hammock and RV etc. Enjoy a self-made breeze!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i32sPmGyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CONBOLA","source_asin":"B0BBM761ZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1017769","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBM761ZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBM761ZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
