window.products.push({"id":1017790,"name":"Foil Plastic Wrap Dispenser 2 in 1 Bamboo Foil Dispenser with Cutter and Labels-Plastic Wrap, Aluminum Foil and Wax Paper Organizer and Storage for Ki","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71toMinC6cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2 in 1 Bamboo Dispenser - This wrap dispenser is made of sturdy and food grade bamboo materials. The 2-slot design makes your kitchen more neat and organized. It will fit most brand of plastic wrap, aluminum foil and wax paper. Built-in 2-Way Cutter - Easy to slide and cut the wrap quickly and smoothly without hurting your hands or get messy with the plastic wraps. 8 Label Choices - Easy to identify each slot with the included stickers. You can name the bamboo organizer clearly or keep it a clean look without stickers. Hanging Option - The wrap dispenser can be hung on the wall through the bottom holes. Saves kitchen space and keeps every surface neat. Superior Durable Material - Which is tough and durable and has no added coating, finely polished by hand, the surface is smooth without burrs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71toMinC6cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sekaer","source_asin":"B09Z2DWV4J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1017790","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z2DWV4J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z2DWV4J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1017791,"name":"Artdix Roman Shades Blinds Window Shades - Light Green 32 W x 72L Inches (1 Piece) Linen Sheer Solid Fabric Custom Made Roman Shades for Windows, Door","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616RQ8LA+sL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"How to measure Inside mount Window Width: To find the width, measure the top, middle and bottom within your window recess. Use the narrowest width as your window width. Window Length: To find the length, measure exact window-recess length at left, middle and right side. Use the longest height as the window length. Window Depth: Minimum 2 inches required. Ordering: Choose a width that is 1/4 inch smaller than the widow width from above. Choose a length that is same or longer than your window length. Outside mount Determine where the roman shade is to be placed. You will need a minimum 7/8 inches of flat mounting space above your window to accommodate the mounting hardware. Width: Choose a roman blind width that is same or greater than the window width. We recommend add 3-6 inches extra to the measured width to maximize light control and privacy. Length: Measure exact measured-length from the top of the proposed headrail location to the base of sill. If there is no sill, measure where you would like the window roman blind to drop. Add 8-10 inches to the length for optimum light control and privacy. Ordering: Choose a width that is same or wider than the product width from above.  Choose a length that is same or longer than your measured length. How to Get a Custom Roman Shade 1. Get the mount type (inside or outside mount) according to your window type 2. Get the roman shade size according to above measurement method 3. Email us the following information 3.1 Product you like (you can send us LINK or ASIN)  3.2 Mount type 3.3 Roman shade size 4. We give you the price and order link 5. Receive the roman shade, if have any problem, please send message to us or call us, we can solve any problem together with you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616RQ8LA+sL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artdix","source_asin":"B07T8DXL6S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1017791","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T8DXL6S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T8DXL6S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
