window.products.push({"id":1017854,"name":"Magicfly Solar Panel Brushless Water Cycle Pump Pond Fountain Rockery Fountain, 9V 1.8W 200mA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bj8PdA-rL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Magicfly Solar Panel Brushless Water Cycle Pump Pond Fountain Rockery Fountain, 9V 1.8W 200mA The product is based on updating the brushless solar pump technology products, overcoming the shortcomings of hard start, low efficiency, poor stability of similar products and even easier to start than the same power brush pump. Specifications: Solar panel power consumption: 9V 1.8W  Brushless pump power consumption: 9V 200mA  Maximum water height: 70CM  Maximum flow: 220L/H  Start: The water pump will not working without sunlight, It will restart within 3 seconds once the sunlight re-appear.  Useful life period: ≥20000Hours  Working hours in the sun: 8:00A.M.-5:00P.M.  Delay: ≤3s  Restart: If sunshine is off, can restart within 3 Seconds when sunshine is back  Color: Black  Size of the solar panel: 180X120X25mm  Net weight: 236g  Cord length: 3M Package dimensions: 187x125x50mm  Package weight: 287g Note: 1.Products for direct-drive solar-powered water pump, no external batteries, a high degree of water depends entirely on the strength of the sun, when the sunlight is weak, water pumps will not work continuously, once sunlight is stronger it will automatically continue to work.  2.Do not submerge solar panels and controllers into water even though it has weak waterproof structure, but not suitable for prolonged immersion in water.  3.Please put the pump into water. Keep the solar panel out of water; otherwise it will get damaged and couldn't work.   Package including:  1x Solar Fountain  1x User manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bj8PdA-rL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magicfly","source_asin":"B00J4B26DU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1017854","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00J4B26DU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00J4B26DU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
